    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You wrap a creature in an aura of primordial vitality, mimicking the protective mantle of the Dragon Between. The target regains 3d8 Hit Points and gains a +1 status bonus to AC and all saving throws for 1 round. If your patron is <strong>Khyber</strong>, this spell can heal undead creatures using void energy instead of living creatures with vitality.</p><p><strong>Heightened (+1):</strong> The healing increases by 1d8.</p>"
    },
